{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Welcome to Garbageland! Your name is Worm! You and your grandma are scavengers, digging through the dangerous, trash-filled wastes of the past. One day,\u00a0she's injured, and you're forced to set out on your own. What follows is a bizarre, quirky adventure where the garbage of the past intersect with the realities of the future.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><strong>Garbageland</strong> is a Breakout/billiards inspired RPG that's in active development! Almost entirely a solo-developer project, I hope you'll support its development by trying the demo and adding it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn sticker book aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging turn-based gameplay with elements of Breakout, billiards, and golf</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pit your enemies against each other and the environment in order to progress and uncover valuable salvage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic cast of characters with unique skills that encourage puzzle-style problem solving</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578380?t=1742187320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578380/01e479dd403307be0604244bbe9d19f8b6054bf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742187320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578380/d13d4ee86dc0993bccf962b7e2a1a821aa890ca7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742187320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578380/d13d4ee86dc0993bccf962b7e2a1a821aa890ca7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742187320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"dem